Package: vitrob
Type: Package
Title: Risk-of-Bias Assessment of In Vitro Experiments with VITROB
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ioannis", "Bellos", , "bellosg@windowslive.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5088-5458"))
Description: Implements VITROB, a result-level, algorithm-based risk-of-bias
    tool for in vitro experiments, modelled on RoB 2 and ROBINS-I V2. The
    signalling questions, skip logic and judgment algorithms are read from a
    single YAML specification. The package proposes domain and overall
    judgments, checks assessment tables for entry errors, writes entry
    templates, draws traffic-light, summary, answer-heatmap and
    reporting-gap plots, provides a point-and-click app, and verifies the
    algorithms exhaustively against an independent reference implementation.
